content:
The invoice_text is truncated but starts with "Amount: 28..." — the correct amount should be 433.49, yet the extracted amount in the invoices table is 433.49 while VAT is 2889.9. The VAT value 2889.9 looks like it could be a misread of a number starting with "28..." from the invoice text. This is consistent with the new extraction prompt (v1.1, "new extraction prompt") incorrectly mapping a field from the document to VAT. The source document's amount field appears to start with "28..." which the new prompt likely extracted as the VAT figure. This is a bad_deploy of invoice-agent, not bad_input — the document structure is normal but the new prompt misreads it.

